_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_{B}"},{"type":"text","value":" 表示）。\n16-III.（i）（3分）洛埃德（H.Lloyd）在1834年提出了一种更简单的观察干涉的装置。如图所示，从单缝 "},{"type":"math","value":"S"},{"type":"text","value":" 发出的光，一部分入射到平面镜后反射到屏上，另一部分直接投射到屏上，在屏上两光束交叠区域里将出现干涉条纹。单缝 "},{"type":"math","value":"S"},{"type":"text","value":" 通过平面镜成的像是 "},{"type":"math","value":"S^{'}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。现应用洛埃德镜研究单色光的干涉现象。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a089f6e8a091ff7791388c7ad633079ca3ce78c5955e4e7f0ff98a761b742874.png","width":693,"height":192,"width_mm":81.492,"row_group":"tianyu-quanguo-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2410-q16-row6"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(1)以下哪些操作能够减小光屏上相邻两条亮纹之间的距离（填空）（多选）；\nA. 将单缝稍向下移动一些\nB. 将平面镜稍向下移动一些\nC. 将光屏稍向左移动一些\nD. 将光源由绿色光改为红色光\n(2)若光源 S 到平面镜的垂直距离和到光屏的垂直距离分别为 h 和 D，光屏上形成的第 2 条亮纹与第 8 条亮纹的中心间距为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x"},{"type":"text","value":" ，单色光的波长 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda ="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空）;\n（ii）(1 分)干簧管是能够感知磁场的常用传感元件，小明在实验中发现一个常开型干簧管，即初始状态两金属片断开，下列哪些操作不能使干簧管闭合（填空）(单选)\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/42d422159e933b1fae9ef541257cf23e125e9c8e09bc62d290a12795a6acd66c.png","width":969,"height":279,"width_mm":113.947,"row_group":"tianyu-quanguo-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2410-q16-row7"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/de034a5175532a90ac23bf0afdc800d5ceeb5e87f7cc151b86bed1653c774d19.png","width":966,"height":231,"width_mm":113.594,"row_group":"tianyu-quanguo-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2410-q16-row8"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.实验题（I、II、III三题共14分）\n16-I.（6分）（1）B（2）AD（2分，漏选得1分）（3）D（4）①C ②D\n16-II.（4分）2 小"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{\\mathrm{A}}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{E_{\\mathrm{A}}}{I_{\\mathrm{B}}}"},{"type":"text","value":"16-III.（4分）(i)BC（2分，漏选得1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda = \\frac{\\Delta xh}{3D}"},{"type":"text","value":"(ii)(1分)A"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--tianyu-quanguo-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2410-q17","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--tianyu-quanguo-mingxia