alue":"\\sin \\theta = \\frac{0.9R - 0.5R}{0.5R} = 0.8\\Rightarrow \\theta = 53^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"则粒子的角度范围在与x轴夹角"},{"type":"math","value":"53^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"范围内（1分）\n（3）区域II中带电粒子在匀强电场中做匀变速曲线运动，类斜抛运动。假设入射粒子与x轴正向夹角为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"。由运动的分解\nx方向:"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}\\cos\\alpha \\cdot t = R"},{"type":"text","value":"y方向:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{Eq}{m} \\cdot t = 2v_{0}\\sin\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）注明：以上两式写对任何一式得1分。\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha = 45^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n由几何关系x坐标为"},{"type":"math","value":"x = \\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} - 1\\right)\\frac{R}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（4）若粒子进入磁场后受到了与速度大小成正比、方向相反的阻力，粒子在磁场的运动轨迹如图所示，由"},{"type":"math","value":"qvB_{2}=m\\omega v"},{"type":"text","value":"可得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega=\\frac{qB_{2}}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（或"},{"type":"math","value":"qv\\times\\frac{\\sqrt{2}B}{4}=m\\omega v"},{"type":"text","value":"可得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}Bq}{4m}"},{"type":"text","value":"）即角速度为一定值，又可知粒子与磁场左边界相切时转过的弧度为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{5}{4}\\pi"},{"type":"text","value":"，则有"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{3}=\\frac{\\frac{5}{4}\\pi}{\\omega}=\\frac{5\\sqrt{2}m\\pi}{2qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n取一小段时间"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":"，对粒子在x方向上列动量定理（如图）"},{"type":"math","value":"- k v \\sin \\theta \\cdot \\Delta t - q v B _ {2} \\cos \\theta \\cdot \\Delta t = m \\Delta v _ {x}"},{"type":"text","value":"两边同时对过程求和"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum -kv\\sin \\theta \\cdot \\Delta t + \\sum -qvB_2\\cos \\theta \\cdot \\Delta t = \\sum m\\Delta v_x"},{"type":"text","value":"可得"},{"type":"math","value":"k\\sum-v\\sin\\theta\\cdot\\Delta t+qB_{2}\\sum-v\\cos\\theta\\cdot\\Delta t=m\\sum\\Delta v_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":"即"},{"type":"math","value":"k\\sum-\\Delta x+qB_{2}\\sum\\Delta y=m\\sum\\Delta v_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）注明：以上三式写对任何一式得1分。\n其中"},{"type":"math","value":"k\\sum-\\Delta x=0"},{"type":"text","value":"则有"},{"type":"math","value":"qB_{2}\\Delta y = -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} mv_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta y = -\\frac{mv_0}{qB_2} = -R"},{"type":"text","value":"故有"},{"type":"math","value":"y_{2}=-R"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d4143a9e6b3e967ed4e95987c030640203c79ff62a14d3717f63ae9b11ddc7c8.png","width":320,"height":259,"width_mm":40.5}]}}]}
